  "protocolVersion": null,
  "instructions": "Price Alibaba Cloud INTERNATIONAL site (alibabacloud.com, USD) resources and build estimates.\nNO-CREDENTIAL tools (always work): calculator_products, calculator_get_schema, calc_ecs_price, calc_rds_price, calculator_price_custom — public list prices from the alibabacloud.com Pricing Calculator for ECS, RDS, WAF 3.0, Security Center, CLB, ALB, NAT, NLB. Prefer these. The bss_* / ecs_price / rds_price / redis_price tools need an AccessKey; if they return MissingCredentials, use calc_* or estimate_add_manual_item instead.\nWorkflow: estimate_create -> price items with ecs_price / rds_price / redis_price / model_studio_price, or for any other product: pricing_recipes -> bss_list_products -> bss_get_pricing_modules -> bss_price_payg / bss_price_subscription. Pass add_to_estimate=<id> to append a priced item. Finish with estimate_export (xlsx/html).\nPrices: *_list = public list price; *_trade = price for the API caller's account after its discounts. If the account is a partner/reseller, export with basis='list' for customers unless told otherwise. Hourly resources use 730 h/month. Never invent module codes - read them from bss_get_pricing_modules.",
